	(text "MIDI IN (TS, J1 bottom left): 8bit / MIDI V2 NPN front end (3.3 V and 5 V senders,\n+/-12 V tolerant), no opto. JP1 (back, shipped OPEN, bridge one pair):\n1-2 = PROTECTED (Q1 drives PB3; firmware PORT_INVEN on PB3),\n2-3 = DIRECT (MIDI_IN to PB3, unprotected; stock BM MCC firmware).\nNever both; open = PB3 floats."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "191acb6e-b667-5397-be49-045a396da13c")
	)
	(text "BANK: SW1 to GND on PC0 (internal pull-up); LEDs on PC1-PC3 through 1k\n(on the MCU side; BM has it on the cathode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1f322a87-4ebe-5fbe-8ef5-2a7c35ace77f")
	)
	(text "MIDI OUT (TS, J2 bottom right): PB2 -> JP2 -> [D2 clamp, R4 1k] -> J2 tip\n(MIDI V2 output protection). JP2 (back, shipped OPEN, bridge one pair):\n1-2 = PROTECTED, 2-3 = DIRECT (PB2 to the tip, as BM).\nThe TX and RX wires cross once without a junction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2a1874ab-424a-53f9-9cc3-39b61c086ee7")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR MCC - S4 schematic (Bread Modular MCC for Eurorack, 6HP): 4 knobs + 4 CV in -> MIDI CC. Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4db51519-65d1-5965-9582-50f4a775ca53")
	)
	(text "OP-AMP SUPPLY: MCP6002 unit C of U4/U5\non +5V, with C6/C7 100n at each package."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 340.36 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "63e56409-2084-5cfc-bae8-bb98b42a7f15")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> B5819W -> +12V_F -> HT7550-1 -> +5V (MCU, op-amps). -12V is not used.\nU3 CJ431 shunt clamps +5V at 5.49 V, so clamp current from a mis-patched jack cannot pump the rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6f71bae9-e470-5dbb-9360-6fe96a932206")
	)
	(text "MCU (U1, drawn mirrored): ATtiny1616 at 5 V. Bread Modular MCC pin map kept:\nPA4-PA7 = knobs 1-4 (AI_PIN..AI_PIN+3), PC0 bank button, PC1-PC3 bank LEDs A/B/C,\nPB3 MIDI RX, PB2 MIDI TX. New: PB0/PB1/PA2/PA3 = CV 1-4 (ADC0 AIN11/10/2/3).\nKnobs and CVs are separate ADC inputs; the firmware decides how they combine.\nSpare: PA1, PB4, PB5. UPDI J4: pin 1 UPDI, pin 2 GND; power from Eurorack while programming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a5c9d5b3-3aba-5e15-87d3-0d9076c7365d")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01/#FLG03/#FLG04 mark the Eurorack GND/-12V/+12V entry at J3; #FLG02 marks +12V_F,\nfed only through D3, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 87.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f7940660-7279-56bc-93c4-4cfd4219e1ef")
	)
	(text "CV 1-4 (8bit CV input, one block each): J1n tip -> R1n 56k / R2n 51k to +5V / R3n 510k to GND:\n-5.5..+5.5 V -> 0..5 V (Zin 102k; unpatched tip normalled to GND = mid-scale, as 8bit).\nD1n BAT54SW clamp, C1n 1n, then a MCP6002 follower on +5V (U4 A/B = CV1/CV2,\nU5 A/B = CV3/CV4), so the MCU pin never leaves 0..5 V. CV1/2 -> PB0/PB1, CV3/4 -> PA2/PA3.\nKNOBS 1-4: RVn 50k linear divider +5V..GND, wiper + C3n 10n straight into PA4-PA7 (as 8bit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fc790c59-f0f5-5156-8ae5-2fbff30a7539")
	)
